        "seg_cer": 0.188,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "和大家一起分享一下，无理取文的方法。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "start": 14.905,
      "end": 19.212,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "用浅色的衣服、纱窗、蚊帐，这样呢把蚊子和人隔开。",
      "score": 0.0914,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0373,
        "sc_logprob": -0.0364,
        "sc_delta": 0.0009,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.2,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "用浅色的衣服、纱窗、蚊帐，之类的把蚊子和影隔开。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "start": 19.36,
      "end": 23.253,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "化学驱蚊呢，就可以选用电蚊香、驱蚊贴、",
      "score": 0.16,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.1776,
        "sc_logprob": -0.2039,
        "sc_delta": -0.0263,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.625,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "法学取文呢，就归选用电文箱取文帖。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "start": 23.253,
      "end": 27.447,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "花露水这些东西。那叮之后啷子消肿止痒呢？",
      "score": 0.5851,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.9773,
        "sc_logprob": -0.961,
        "sc_delta": 0.0164,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.686,
        "seg_cer": 0.667,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.273,
        "phon_examples": "止/子 子/只 露/入",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "发入水这东西，来顶之后，两只小中子养的。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "start": 27.684,
      "end": 31.52,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "冷敷啊，就是最简单的办法。不管你是拿冷水冲，",
      "score": 0.0481,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0083,
        "sc_logprob": -0.0112,
        "sc_delta": -0.0029,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.105,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "冷敷啊，就是最简单的办法。不管你是那冷水虫。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "start": 31.52,
      "end": 35.574,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "还是拿冰块敷，都可以减轻局部的胀痛感。",
      "score": 0.0,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.001,
